{"product":{"id":4595424526401,"title":"ABBA CB06 Square LED Cabinet Downlight - Multiple Color Temperatures\/Finishes","body_html":"\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBody Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cast Brushed Aluminum\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePower:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.5W DC 12V COB\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e-(P.D. COB= Chip On Board, new technology for the LED light engine)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLight Color Temperature:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eWarm White 3000K OR Cool White 5000K (Dimmable LED)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c\/strong\u003e White, Black, or Silver\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003eSize:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.55″ (Square) x .75″ (Depth) x 1.75″ (Cutout)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumens: \u003c\/strong\u003e80 LM\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBeam Angle: \u003c\/strong\u003e24.2°\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGive your space the perfect ambient lighting with this square architecture surface-mounted LED downlight. This cast brushed aluminum square puck light is energy efficient, dimmable and recessed, so it saves your electricity cost and avoids taking up space. It has 3 charming finishes including black, white and silver, choose a color that matches your liking and design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts size is 2.55″ (Square) x .75″ (Depth) x 1.75″ (Cutout). The integrated 1.5W DC 12V COB LED bulb emits light at a 24.2-degree narrow beam angle and gives 80 Lumens, 3000K temperature of warm white light.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"ABBA Lighting","product_type":"LED Cabinet Lights","creat